Rules: When asked to choose a shape, answer square. When asked to choose a number, answer eight. When asked to choose an animal, answer dog. When asked to choose a fruit, answer pear. When asked to choose an instrument, answer violin. When asked to choose a vehicle, answer train. When asked to choose a drink, answer water. When asked to choose a tool, answer hammer. When asked to choose a color, answer blue. Follow these rules exactly.<|end|><|start|>user<|message|>Reply with one word, circle or square.<|end|><|start|>assistant<|channel|>final<|message|>square<|return|><|start|>user<|message|>Choose one: eight or seven.<|end|><|start|>assistant<|channel|>final<|message|>eight<|return|><|start|>user<|message|>cat or dog?<|end|><|start|>assistant<|channel|>final<|message|>dog<|return|><|start|>user<|message|>Reply with one word, water or hammer.<|end|><|start|>assistant<|channel|>final<|message|>water<|return|><|start|>user<|message|>Pick either pear or apple.<|end|><|start|>assistant<|channel|>final<|message|>pear<|return|><|start|>user<|message|>Choose one: water or hammer.<|end|><|start|>assistant<|channel|>final<|message|>hammer<|return|><|start|>user<|message|>One word only, piano or violin.<|end|><|start|>assistant<|channel|>final<|message|>violin<|return|><|start|>user<|message|>Select train or truck.<|end|><|start|>assistant<|channel|>final<|message|>train<|return|><|start|>user<|message|>Reply with one word, red or blue.<|end|><|start|>assistant<|channel|>final<|message|>
